OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 25 APR
OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GFrom the 2024 BBC Proms, the BBC
OL,6,     GNational Orchestra of Wales and
OL,7,     Gconductor Ryan Bancroft play
OL,8,     GSchoenberg and Zemlinsky. Penny
OL,9,     GGore presents.
OL,10,G0630FBreakfast
OL,11,     GHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,12,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,13,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,14,G0900FSaturday Morning
OL,15,     GTom Service with guests, stories
OL,16,     Gand the perfect classical
OL,17,     Gsoundtrack for the weekend. Tom's
OL,18,     Gguest is the mezzo-soprano Dame
OL,19,     GSarah Connolly.
OL,20,G1200FEarlier... with Jools Holland
OL,21,     GJools is joined by singer and
OL,22,     Gbandleader Rolf Stahlhofen.
