OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 25 APR
OL,4,G1300FKey Changes: Radio 3's Essential
OL,5,     FHistory of Classical Music
OL,6,     GThe year is 1415. The Battle of
OL,7,     GAgincourt heralds a profound
OL,8,     Gchange in the sound of music.
OL,9,G1400FRecord Review
OL,10,     GIn Building a Library, conductor
OL,11,     GBen Gernon picks his favourite
OL,12,     Grecordings of Respighi's 'La
OL,13,     GBoutique Fantasque' whilst Fiona
OL,14,     GMaddocks casts an ear over the
OL,15,     Gweek's new releases.
OL,16,G1600FSound of Cinema
OL,17,     GJoin Edith Bowman for your weekly
OL,18,     Gdose of film music- Craig
OL,19,     GArmstrong takes a look at the
OL,20,     Gmusic for 2001: A Space Odyssey,
OL,21,     Gand actor Matthew Kelly reveals
OL,22,     Ghis Pick of the Flicks.
